00001| //! Data model — CONTRACT §2.
00002| //!
00003| //! All types are `serde` snake_case, `Clone` + `Debug`. Timestamps are
00004| //! RFC3339 UTC strings; ids are `<prefix>_<16 hex>`.
00005| 
